  "label": "pinto bean",
  "description": "A pinto bean is a type of legume, commonly used in Mexican and Southwestern U.S. cuisine. In the meme, it is used as a disparaging metaphor to describe the legroom of the Humvee as being as cramped as the space inside a pinto bean — implying it is extremely small and uncomfortable. This is a crude, degrading comparison that trivializes the vehicle's interior space.",
